# Feature security review

Before the final response on a task that added a feature, fixed a bug, or otherwise changed who can do what, what data is read or written, or which requests run, read and follow `.cursor/skills/feature-security-review/SKILL.md`.

Skip when the task was a question, a review, or a plan with no behavior change, or when the only edits are formatting, comments, or docs. Skip a small, simple change that only swaps an icon, image, font, or other static asset, or only changes copy or styling. Skip when the user asks to skip the security review.

A short diff still needs the review when it changes access, stored data, or which requests run.
